          "author": "",
          "description": "This free digital card was made by an Independent Creator and published on Yoto Space. Visit Open Mic on Yoto Space to discover more great free titles!  \n\nCreator: Tender Tales  \nFrom the Creator: “These interactive short stories, trivia, and a catchy song are perfect for kids who love trucks and construction. From ice cream trucks to excavators, each story turns everyday challenges into exciting adventures. Along the journey, kids explore themes of resilience, patience, and empathy. Tender Tales are inclusive stories that celebrate all children and families 🏳️‍🌈”  \n\nFor ages: 3-7   \n\nIf your family enjoyed this card, why not let the creator know by adding a comment on Open Mic?  \n\nFeatured on Discover until 1st December \nStays in your library and available on Yoto Space at any time",
